Three other things I forgot to add:

-- books need precautions to read. Make sure they're uncursed, lock
yourself in a broom closet before reading, wear gloves and have a
unicorn horn available. Even that isn't perfect but it's better than
nothing.

-- Wands of digging, scrolls of teleport are extremely plentiful in
the game.
There's a reason for that. Use them.

-- Read David Damerall's excellent Object identification spoiler. When
you've learned how to identify stuff in the dungeon without killing
yourself, you're more than halfway to winning the game.

